# Secrets — never commit
*.private
*_private_key
*_key
!*_key.pub
/prototype/configs/wireguard/*.conf
!/prototype/configs/wireguard/*.example

# Live-system "evidence" — kept on disk for reference, never committed
prototype/configs/**/*.current
prototype/configs/**/current.*
*~
.*.swp
.DS_Store
._*
node_modules/
*.log

# Compiled daemon binaries — built in the vpn-pi-daemon repo, not tracked here
/daemon/
# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# Go build / test artifacts (built binaries live under */dist/, ignored locally)
*.test
coverage.out

# Agent context — kept on disk for the coding agent, not part of the submission
/CLAUDE.md

# LLM briefs / agent scratch — kept on disk for reference, never committed
**/llm-*.md

# macOS / cloud-sync conflict copies (e.g. "main 2.py")
* [0-9].*
